UID:reminder-20270614-e4bf0d1f-1
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering GOLDA\, whose 8th Yahrzeit occ
 urs on Tuesday\, June 15\, corresponding to the 10th of Sivan\, 5787.\n\nG
 OLDA’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Monday\, June 14 and continues unti
 l sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to light a memorial ca
 ndle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved one’s soul be bou
 nd up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory serve as a continue
 d source of inspiration and comfort to you.
